  <section aria-labelledby="minimal-about">
    <h2 id="minimal-about">About</h2>
    <p>Hi, I’m Lee. I’m an independent consultant in Atlanta, by way of the DC area. I work through GOODNEIGHBOR, my consulting practice for research, strategy, and design.</p>
    <p>My training is in social science, and my work has moved between public health and global health ethics. I draw on interviews, fieldwork, participatory research, and design to help teams think through difficult program decisions.</p>
    <p>I’m interested in tools and how we use them.</p>
  </section>

